WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Black Canadians no longer have to justify their place at the table,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.000
because we are building the tables ourselves.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Organizing between our communities, across our nationalities,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.500
across all our many different political divides,

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
and then building solidarities with our Indigenous comrades.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
The chance to exchange, collaborate and take action.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
I am no longer accepting the things I cannot change.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.500
I am changing the things I cannot accept.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Standing together, we are a movement.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.976
For more information, visit blackcanadiansummit.ca.
